{"at": "2026-08-23T14:47:37.073667+00:00", "event_id": "01M0QHERVHZC8HQQGP7TGHN4CW", "event_type": "DecisionPointOpened", "payload": {"actor_id": "cli", "actor_type": "human", "decision_point_id": "01M0QHERVHZC8HQQGP7TGHN4CV", "input_key": "persona_layout_boundary", "mission_id": "01M0QHDH2H1SM31VEYRD8G1D8P", "mission_slug": "component-system-and-theme-01M0QHDH", "mission_type": "software-dev", "options": ["M2 ships the Persona layout shell; M3 owns persona pages + audience/related/reference blocks + citation catalog", "Defer the Persona layout entirely to M3; M2 proves per-kind-layout override via Hub only", "Other"], "origin_flow": "specify", "origin_surface": "planning_interview", "phase": "SPECIFY", "question": "Does the Persona per-kind LAYOUT (the passport shell resolved through the merged manifest) ship in M2 as a theme/brand organism, or defer entirely to M3 alongside persona authoring and audience-resolution?", "recorded_at": "2026-08-23T14:47:37.073667Z", "run_id": "01M0QHERVHZC8HQQGP7TGHN4CV", "state_entered_at": "2026-08-23T14:47:37.073172Z", "step_id": "specify.scope.persona-layout-boundary"}}
{"at": "2026-08-23T14:50:37.620532+00:00", "event_id": "01M0QHM95MTFHQYBMH712PR9YZ", "event_type": "DecisionPointResolved", "payload": {"actual_participants": [], "closed_locally_while_widened": false, "closure_message": null, "decision_point_id": "01M0QHERVHZC8HQQGP7TGHN4CV", "final_answer": "M2 ships the Persona per-kind LAYOUT shell (passport card: identity strip, <dl> field grid, avatar from hero_image.alt) resolved through the merged manifest, rendering existing M1 frontmatter fields. It proves manifest-driven per-kind-layout override with two bespoke layouts (Hub + Persona). M3 owns persona-PAGE authoring, audience-resolution, and the audience/related/external-reference BLOCKS plus the citation catalog. Boundary line: per-kind layout SHELLS = M2 (theme concern); content-resolution BLOCKS that resolve links to other pages = M3.", "mission_id": "01M0QHDH2H1SM31VEYRD8G1D8P", "mission_slug": "component-system-and-theme-01M0QHDH", "mission_type": "software-dev", "origin_surface": "planning_interview", "other_answer": false, "rationale": null, "recorded_at": "2026-08-23T14:50:37.620532Z", "resolved_by": "cli", "run_id": "01M0QHERVHZC8HQQGP7TGHN4CV", "state_entered_at": "2026-08-23T14:50:37.619729Z", "summary": null, "terminal_outcome": "resolved"}}
